ee browser-based collectible card game inspired by the Minecraft universe. Three free boosters a day are opened one card at a time, and the 222 cards of the Genesis Blocks expansion are spread across five rarities in classic or Full Art printings, with duplicates sold for Sparks to buy the cards still missing. Between openings, players break daily blocks in the Mine for resources, deal with the Wandering Trader, swap cards with friends, earn experience and trophies, and customise a profile card. No sign-up or external server is needed: the collection, resources and statistics stay in the browser, and saves can be exported and imported at any time.", "themes": [{"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/minecards"}